      "content": "i cant even sleep lately. i just lay there thinking about everything and it feels so pointless. like, why even bother building a life or a career or anything when the planet is basically a ticking time bomb? it feels like we're all just decorating a sinking ship. everything feels so heavy and hopeless.",
